<title>POLAND: KABLE OCT NET FALLS TO PLN 700,100.</title>
<headline>KABLE OCT NET FALLS TO PLN 700,100.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results October</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>OCTOBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.70 vs   0.92</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.71 vs   0.92</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.86 vs   0.93</p>
<p> Sales		   12.19 vs  14.42</p>
<p>JANUARY-OCTOBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.93 vs   4.30</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.94 vs   4.31</p>
<p> Operating profit     2.61 vs   4.74</p>
<p> Sales		  110.20 vs  94.99</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish cable-maker is Slaska Fabryka</p>
<p>Kabli SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
